# Dev Crew kit: never in Git. Secrets, local settings, data and copies of live systems live outside the repository
# (in the local-data folder); these lines catch a stray one. Merge with the project's own .gitignore.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.dump
*.log
.claude/settings.local.json
local.properties
node_modules/
